        "preconditions": {
          "text": "USDM, the underlying asset of the sUSDM vault, has 6 decimals.; sUSDM overrides _decimalsOffset() to return 6.; An external protocol integrating sUSDM uses the standard ERC-20 pattern of interpreting balanceOf() using decimals().",
